; GBPUSD combined config: only ONE toggle showed even a small improvement
; over G0_baseline (PF 1.03) - vol-scaling ON (G2: PF 1.06, exp $1.30).
; Friday-flatten-off (G4) was roughly neutral (PF 1.04) so left as-is.
; Both session-window guesses (G5 London, G6 NY) were considerably
; WORSE than baseline, not better - GBPUSD's real active-hours window
; is still unknown; this config does NOT attempt to fix that.
; Read this result honestly: even best-case, GBPUSD is marginal
; (PF ~1.06, DD ~6-7% vs XAUUSD's ~3%) - this run is to confirm the
; floor, not to find a deployable edge.
; Run: python autotest.py --model 1 --symbol GBPUSD G7_gbp_tuned

